SCOPE
=====

The MIT License below applies to the SOURCE CODE in this repository:
`src/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, and `notebooks/`.

It does NOT apply to:

  - `data/`            Human-subject interview transcripts and note-taker records.
  - `config/agents/`   Agent personas derived from those interviews.
  - `paper/`           The manuscript.
  - `results/`         Simulation logs and evaluation outputs derived from the above.

Those materials were collected from identifiable research participants and are
included for verification of the reported results only. They may not be
redistributed, republished, or used to identify participants. For any other use,
contact the authors.


